{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48891","headline":"过南城县麻姑山 一 · 崔橹","name":"过南城县麻姑山 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"似前如却玉堆堆，薄带轻烟翠好裁。\n斜倚兔钩孤影伴，校低仙掌一头来。\n盘疑虎伏形难写，展认龙拏势未回。\n惊讶昔人曾羽化，此中争不接瑶台。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔橹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48891.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48891","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}